# =====================================================================
# Photographs
# =====================================================================
# The captain's own photographs are dropped into app/static/assets/photos/
# and are committed on purpose — the manifest in
# app/static/data/gallery.json is what says which ones the site expects.
# Only the working files that come with a camera are kept out.
app/static/assets/photos/*.psd
app/static/assets/photos/*.CR2
app/static/assets/photos/*.NEF
app/static/assets/photos/*.dng
app/static/assets/photos/originals/
